{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch72fEaL3xschUcLgg7mc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't include the line saying a gift this month guarantees every child on the waiting list a place in January. The numbers can't back it up:\n\n- Placing all 61 children costs **$70,150**.\n- If you get the full match, you'd have **$30,000**: $15,000 from donors plus $15,000 from the foundation. That pays for about **26 children**.\n- Last December this group gave **$1,240**. Even if all 340 donors gave $85 again, the total with the match would be about $43,900, still well short.\n\nThese are people who already lost trust in you once. Your former board member forwards your emails with her comments, and a promise you can't keep would very likely end up in one of those forwards. So the draft uses goals you can actually meet: $575 pays for one child's year once it's matched, and the full match places 26 kids.\n\n**Two other choices:**\n- **I mentioned Eastside directly.** If the people who stopped giving after the closure get an appeal that ignores it, it will read as tone-deaf. There's a bracketed spot for one true sentence about what has changed since then. If nothing honest fits there, delete it. The acknowledgment works without it.\n- **Words:** about 190, so there's room for that sentence.\n\n<final_document>\n**Subject:** 61 kids are waiting, and your gift counts twice this month\n\nDear [First Name],\n\nIt's been a while, and I want to start with something you may still be thinking about. When we closed the Eastside branch in 2022, many of you told us how much it hurt. You were right to say so, and we heard you. [Optional: one true sentence on what has changed since then.]\n\nHere's where things stand now: 61 children are on our waiting list for subsidized lessons. A year of weekly lessons costs us $1,150 per child.\n\nThrough December 31, a family foundation will match every gift from returning donors dollar for dollar, up to $15,000. That means:\n\n- **$575** pays for a full year of lessons for one child.\n- **$85** becomes **$170** for a child on the list.\n\nIf we reach the full match, that's $30,000, enough to move 26 children off the waiting list and into lessons this January.\n\nEvery gift gets a child closer to their first lesson.\n\n**[Give now and double your gift →]**\n\nThank you for what you gave before. We'd love to have you back.\n\nWith gratitude,\n\n[Executive Director Name]\nExecutive Director, [School Name]\n</final_document>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5422,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5422},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0257bcde-7b63-48a7-9e8c-aee0e14dcd5f","uuid":"5b0fc1c8-4bca-4194-8207-abfea6e275a4","timestamp":"2026-11-16T17:49:59.303Z","request_id":"req_011Ch72fERQs4KYA2W8nDRGt"}
